vLLM file overlays for the MiMo-V2.6-Flash four-Spark recipe
============================================================

These directories are bind-mounted read-only over the vLLM package of the image
myllmbox/mimo-v26-flash-cluster-vllm:v2 (image ID sha256:a09549748e0b42d5d89608888b55a826ead04a2d7a7b5318c47dcf8ea0593ace;
vLLM nightly ddd6fbca plus myllmbox's changes) by launcher/vllm-rank.sh, after `sha256sum -c` of each directory's
SHA256SUMS. Each listed path is relative to the vllm package (/usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/vllm/).
They are identical to the overlays in production on our ring on 2026-10-01, apart from one comment line in
vllm-patches-attn2 (a reference to a private repository removed); do not edit them without
regenerating SHA256SUMS, and rebuild them from the new image's copies if you change the image.

